{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790386181349,"sessionID":"ses_f24af1fccffeVGzOxvrYvfXIwI","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_fy0w69HdubUW4gyoWLbqFF5m","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: _generate_player.gd\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+const DIRECTIONS := [2, 1, 0, 7, 6, 5, 4, 3]\n+\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\tvar player := CharacterBody2D.new()\n+\tplayer.name = \"Player\"\n+\tplayer.motion_mode = CharacterBody2D.MOTION_MODE_FLOATING\n+\n+\tvar animated_sprite := AnimatedSprite2D.new()\n+\tanimated_sprite.name = \"AnimatedSprite2D\"\n+\tanimated_sprite.sprite_frames = _build_sprite_frames()\n+\tanimated_sprite.animation = &\"idle0\"\n+\tanimated_sprite.speed_scale = 2.0\n+\tplayer.add_child(animated_sprite)\n+\tanimated_sprite.owner = player\n+\n+\tvar collision_shape := CollisionShape2D.new()\n+\tcollision_shape.name = \"CollisionShape2D\"\n+\tcollision_shape.position = Vector2(7, 44)\n+\tvar rectangle := RectangleShape2D.new()\n+\trectangle.size = Vector2(66, 24)\n+\tcollision_shape.shape = rectangle\n+\tplayer.add_child(collision_shape)\n+\tcollision_shape.owner = player\n+\n+\tvar scene := PackedScene.new()\n+\tif scene.pack(player) != OK:\n+\t\tpush_error(\"Failed to pack Player scene\")\n+\t\tquit(1)\n+\t\treturn\n+\tif ResourceSaver.save(scene, \"res://scenes/Player.tscn\") != OK:\n+\t\tpush_error(\"Failed to save Player scene\")\n+\t\tquit(1)\n+\t\treturn\n+\tquit()\n+\n+\n+func _build_sprite_frames() -> SpriteFrames:\n+\tvar frames := SpriteFrames.new()\n+\tframes.remove_animation(&\"default\")\n+\t_add_directional_animations(\n+\t\tframes,\n+\t\t\"idle\",\n+\t\tload(\"res://assets/isometric_Mini-Crusader/crusader_idle.png\"),\n+\t\t16\n+\t)\n+\t_add_directional_animations(\n+\t\tframes,\n+\t\t\"run\",\n+\t\tload(\"res://assets/isometric_Mini-Crusader/crusader_walk.png\"),\n+\t\t15\n+\t)\n+\treturn frames\n+\n+\n+func _add_directional_animations(\n+\tframes: SpriteFrames,\n+\tprefix: String,\n+\ttexture: Texture2D,\n+\tcolumn_count: int\n+) -> void:\n+\tvar frame_size := Vector2(texture.get_width() / column_count, texture.get_height() / 8)\n+\tfor direction in 8:\n+\t\tvar animation := StringName(prefix + str(direction))\n+\t\tframes.add_animation(animation)\n+\t\tframes.set_animation_loop(animation, true)\n+\t\tframes.set_animation_speed(animation, 5.0)\n+\t\tfor column in column_count:\n+\t\t\tvar frame := AtlasTexture.new()\n+\t\t\tframe.atlas = texture\n+\t\t\tframe.region = Rect2(\n+\t\t\t\tVector2(column * frame_size.x, DIRECTIONS[direction] * frame_size.y),\n+\t\t\t\tframe_size\n+\t\t\t)\n+\t\t\tframes.add_frame(animation, frame)\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA workspace/_generate_player.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/_generate_player.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/_generate_player.gd\n+++ /workspace/_generate_player.gd\n@@ -0,0 +1,77 @@\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+const DIRECTIONS := [2, 1, 0, 7, 6, 5, 4, 3]\n+\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\tvar player := CharacterBody2D.new()\n+\tplayer.name = \"Player\"\n+\tplayer.motion_mode = CharacterBody2D.MOTION_MODE_FLOATING\n+\n+\tvar animated_sprite := AnimatedSprite2D.new()\n+\tanimated_sprite.name = \"AnimatedSprite2D\"\n+\tanimated_sprite.sprite_frames = _build_sprite_frames()\n+\tanimated_sprite.animation = &\"idle0\"\n+\tanimated_sprite.speed_scale = 2.0\n+\tplayer.add_child(animated_sprite)\n+\tanimated_sprite.owner = player\n+\n+\tvar collision_shape := CollisionShape2D.new()\n+\tcollision_shape.name = \"CollisionShape2D\"\n+\tcollision_shape.position = Vector2(7, 44)\n+\tvar rectangle := RectangleShape2D.new()\n+\trectangle.size = Vector2(66, 24)\n+\tcollision_shape.shape = rectangle\n+\tplayer.add_child(collision_shape)\n+\tcollision_shape.owner = player\n+\n+\tvar scene := PackedScene.new()\n+\tif scene.pack(player) != OK:\n+\t\tpush_error(\"Failed to pack Player scene\")\n+\t\